      <h2 id="summary">In short</h2>
      <ul class="tick-list">
        <li>We ask only for what we need to understand your enquiry.</li>
        <li>We share your details with a professional only if you have agreed to that.</li>
        <li>We do not ask for passwords, OTPs, identity documents or financial records with an enquiry.</li>
      </ul>

      <h2 id="who">Who is responsible for your details</h2>
      <p>AccountOrbit is owned by {{ site.owner.name }}. You can reach us on <a href="{{ site.phoneHref }}">{{ site.phoneDisplay }}</a>.</p>
      <p>{% pending "the operating entity and registered address, an email address, and the person who handles privacy requests and complaints." %}</p>

      <h2 id="collect">What we collect, and why</h2>
      <section class="data-table-wrap" tabindex="0" aria-label="Data collected, scrolls sideways on small screens">
        <table class="data-table">
