      <p>If you call us, we may note the same kinds of details. {% pending "whether calls are recorded. If they are, this must be stated here and at the start of the call." %}</p>

      <h2 id="not-collect">What we do not ask for</h2>
      <p>With an enquiry, we do not ask for portal passwords, OTPs, PAN or Aadhaar scans, bank statements or tax filings. If you engage a professional, any records you share later are between you and them, using a method you agree with them.</p>

      <h2 id="share">Who may see your details</h2>
      <ul>
        <li><strong>AccountOrbit,</strong> to review your enquiry.</li>
        <li><strong>A professional being considered for your work,</strong> only if you have ticked the separate sharing box or agreed by phone. Once they have your details, their own privacy practices also apply, so ask them.</li>
        <li><strong>Service providers we use to run the enquiry system.</strong> {% pending "the form processor, hosting and any other processors, and where they store data." %}</li>
        <li><strong>Authorities,</strong> where the law requires it.</li>
      </ul>
      <p>{% pending "whether any professional pays for an introduction, which this policy would then need to disclose." %}</p>

      <h2 id="choices">Your choices</h2>
      <p>India's Digital Personal Data Protection framework gives you the right to withdraw consent as easily as you gave it, to exercise your rights under the Act, and to complain to the Data Protection Board. We intend to meet this standard from the day the form opens, even if some of its requirements take effect later.</p>
      <p>{% pending "the exact route for withdrawing consent, asking to see, correct or delete your details, and making a complaint, with response times." %}</p>
      <p>If a professional already has your details, withdrawing consent with us does not by itself remove them from that professional's records. You may need to ask them as well. {% pending "whether AccountOrbit will pass on such requests." %}</p>

      <h2 id="keep">How long we keep details</h2>
      <p>{% pending "the retention period for enquiries, including those that did not lead to an introduction." %}</p>

      <h2 id="security">How details are protected</h2>
      <p>{% pending "the safeguards in place once a form backend exists." %}</p>

      <h2 id="site">Cookies and this website</h2>
      <p>As built today, this site sets no cookies of its own, loads no third-party fonts or scripts, and runs no analytics or advertising trackers. If that changes, this section must be updated first. Your hosting provider may keep ordinary server logs. Links to government portals, ICAI and social media take you to sites with their own policies.</p>

      <h2 id="age">Children</h2>
      <p>AccountOrbit is intended for adults enquiring for themselves or a business. Please do not submit details about a child.</p>

      <h2 id="changes">Changes to this policy</h2>
      <p>We will update this page if our practices change, and show the date of the latest version. {% pending "the effective date." %}</p>
